			"Message": "chore(Wind): Untrack and ignore TypeScript declaration emit artifacts\n\nRemove 12 TypeScript .d.ts + .d.ts.map compilation artifacts from\nSource/Codegen/ and Source/Configuration/ESBuild/Wind.js (esbuild output).\nThese are build-time files generated by tsc/esbuild during compilation,\nnot hand-authored source.\n\nAdd Source/**/*.d.ts and Source/**/*.d.ts.map to .gitignore as a broad\ncatch-all — TypeScript declarations should never be committed alongside\ntheir .ts sources.",
